ions and step-confined exchange; external-test opt-in; provider overlays; 3600-second sweep bound; and always-uploaded unique raw results.\n- `terraform-drift.yml` — Preserve Terraform-path PR plus daily/manual triggers; independent fmt/plan jobs; plan-only OIDC; full-history checkout and current-tree assertion; Terraform 1.11.4 floor; validate-before-plan; detailed exit codes with `-lock=false`; advisory role outside Gerrit Verified; and the exact `mechanism-ok: ci_gate` marker.\n- `test.yml` — Preserve ordinary pushes excluding `feature/**`, `main`, and `tickets`; all PRs; six-hour/manual health; same-ref cancellation; shared Gerrit workflows; schedule-only mutation omission; clean-install path; soft last-green/bisect report; external self-skip behavior; breadth-tier distinctions; nonblocking link check; and the exact existing `predates-gate-ok` marker. For the named Windows exclusive-leg proof, condense the explanatory blocks before the `mechanism-ok` marker and between the step name and `continue-on-error`; preserve the complete `mechanism-ok: ci_gate` marker, if-present guard, bash shell, nonblocking disposition, placement before the default suite, and verbose platform-test command. Do not claim every trigger runs the full suite.\n- `verify-identity.yml` — Preserve config-driven advisory authentication and grandfathering; triggers/exclusions; full-history blobless checkout; temporary fail-closed pack limit with restoration; tickets worktree; ancestry-based key verification; object-database immutability; and config-driven op-cert verification without CI overrides.\n\nConsumers are GitHub Actions, Gerrit Verified, release and Terraform operators, PyPI/MCP Registry/GitHub Releases, Jira/tickets reconciliation, CloudWatch, and repository workflow-policy tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Only allowlisted standalone comments or adjacent blank lines change in the six paths; workflow data, embedded shell, and directives remain exact.\n- [x] [non-codebase] Every Scope constraint and consumer has a concrete before/final PASS citation in a leaf-linked TSV authored by a reviewer who did not write the remediation.\n  provenance: environment=isolated-local-review-worktree; principal=/root:couped-parttime-nag-independent-review; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=static-analysis — Reviewed the immutable before and source-commit blobs and recorded the exact 56-row receipt in linked tracker session logs.\n- [x] [non-codebase] Every edited block is shorter and records `semantic-preservation=PASS` and `bloat-removal=PASS`; missing or failing rows block closure.\n  provenance: environment=isolated-local-review-worktree; principal=/root:couped-parttime-nag-independent-review; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=static-analysis — Counted every reviewed block and recorded strict shrink plus both PASS dispositions in all 56 linked TSV rows.\n- [x] The comment-only guard, directive census, focused workflow tests, path-scoped `git diff --check`, and worktree-venv repository gate pass.\n\n## Verification\nRun the recorded comment-only and exact-directive guards, focused workflow suites, path-scoped diff check, and worktree-venv lint. The independent TSV is authoritative for prose quality.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/release.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/structured-output-baseline.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/terraform-drift.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/test.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":".github/workflows/verify-identity.yml","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"],["relates_to","00d6-9137-d563-460c"],["relates_to","0bec-70c6-f8c2-4825"],["relates_to","4601-c4cf-2190-4c28"],["relates_to","4802-a252-a649-42ee"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"9a75411b-dd63-4052-ae08-937cd2eb803e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"760e-8033-ada8-4bc5","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in .github/workflows — cohort 02: reconcile-bridge–verify-identity","verify_commands":[{"command":"rtk git diff --exit-code --ignore-matching-lines=\"^([[:space:]]*#[^!].*|[[:space:]]*#[[:space:]]*|[[:space:]]*;.*|[[:space:]]*<!--.*|[[:space:]]*.*-->|[[:space:]]*)$\" HEAD^ HEAD -- .github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml .github/workflows/release.yml .github/workflows/structured-output-baseline.yml .github/workflows/terraform-drift.yml .github/workflows/test.yml .github/workflows/verify-identity.yml","dd_id":"preserve-workflow-data","dd_text":"Prove the leaf commit changes only standalone comments or blank lines in declared workflow paths."},{"command":"rtk proxy env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python -c 'import re,subprocess,sys\npat=re.compile(r\"#\\s*(?:shellcheck\\b|zizmor:|predates-gate-ok:|mechanism-ok:)\",re.I)\ndef rows(ref,path):\n lines=subprocess.check_output([\"git\",\"show\",f\"{ref}:{path}\"],text=True).splitlines()\n out=[]\n for i,line in enumerate(lines):\n  if pat.search(line):\n   nxt=next((x for x in lines[i+1:] if x.strip() and not x.lstrip().startswith(\"#\")),\"<EOF>\")\n   out.append((line,nxt))\n return out\nbad=[p for p in sys.argv[1:] if rows(\"HEAD^\",p)!=rows(\"HEAD\",p)]\nassert not bad,f\"workflow directive text or attachment changed: {bad}\"' .github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml .github/workflows/release.yml .github/workflows/structured-output-baseline.yml .github/workflows/terraform-drift.yml .github/workflows/test.yml .github/workflows/verify-identity.yml","dd_id":"directive-preservation","dd_text":"Preserve shellcheck, zizmor, predates-gate, and mechanism markers with their code attachment."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/workflow/test_reconcile_workflow_lint.py tests/unit/workflow/test_bridge_primary_workflow_heldout.py tests/interfaces/store/test_reconcile_workflow_merge_driver.py tests/interfaces/store/test_reconcile_workflow_no_shallow_rebase.py tests/scripts/test_reconcile_bridge_push_retry.py","dd_id":"reconcile-contracts","dd_text":"Exercise reconciliation workflow concurrency, merge-driver, history, and push-retry contracts."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_release_workflow_pins.py tests/unit/test_release_guards.py tests/unit/test_mcp_publisher_pin.py tests/unit/test_dependency_advisory_wiring.py tests/unit/test_structured_matrix_scorer.py","dd_id":"release-structured-contracts","dd_text":"Exercise release pins/guards, publisher provenance, advisory wiring, and structured matrix behavior."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_terraform_drift_workflow_shape.py tests/unit/test_terraform_tree_currency.py tests/unit/test_terraform_drift_version_pin.py tests/unit/test_opcert_deploy_infra.py::test_terraform_ci_runs_fmt_check_and_validate","dd_id":"terraform-contracts","dd_text":"Exercise drift workflow shape, tree currency, version floor, and validation wiring."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest -q tests/unit/test_ci_main_push_policy.py tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py tests/unit/test_main_health_report.py tests/unit/test_ci_tickets_partial_clone_workflows.py tests/unit/test_ci_tickets_push_policy.py tests/unit/test_verify_opcert_heldout.py tests/unit/test_verify_gate_parity.py tests/unit/test_ci_actionlint_scope.py","dd_id":"ci-identity-contracts","dd_text":"Exercise CI trigger/parity, guard, health, ticket-store, identity, op-cert, and actionlint contracts."},{"command":"rtk git diff --check HEAD^ HEAD -- .github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml .github/workflows/release.yml .github/workflows/structured-output-baseline.yml .github/workflows/terraform-drift.yml .github/workflows/test.yml .github/workflows/verify-identity.yml","dd_id":"diff-integrity","dd_text":"Reject whitespace errors in declared workflow paths."},{"command":"rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint","dd_id":"repository-gates","dd_text":"Run repository lint and policy gates with the worktree virtualenv."}]},"source_event_uuids":["06aea974-6947-4844-a51a-d972a806b592","b5acfe08-3dbf-4f27-9cc7-04018df7f9c5","4151c4c6-500f-4351-8fd4-5c80d50d8ab0","3fcca33d-1c9b-469b-ae10-08d24e1e0f3f","4a68625d-d4ab-4a0c-9326-783f8d672b4a","d7fc8bd4-85fc-424c-8d8c-aecc2134e530","86078b75-6eac-4025-ba26-5b1d7231f317","7e9de807-d5b1-4e2c-b824-073388348214","401ce0ff-5524-496d-80b8-cf006812a002","dbc82a46-932d-4cb4-8b68-006c105e063c","e84c3c1a-cf05-4326-8bf1-6780f26a6fc2","a93330bf-8953-46cb-abd8-956a5eb699aa","9a75411b-dd63-4052-ae08-937cd2eb803e","8f6d2dbc-dd70-41be-b70f-1112a50a6d0f","642ddacb-6960-4011-8761-9d3490abd578"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788884977338016001,"uuid":"61b7dcc8-7561-46a1-81a1-0bd4b5b8d491"}